"Tuyet is a petite, sweet Meister with bangs whose weapons are darts."
"She carries eight pale, nacre-like darts in a metal case and enhances them magically."
"She was accepted into the CNH hero track as a Quarter 2 student and plans to room with Maricel."
"She is an S-rank Dart Meister who rooms with Maricel and Vandy at CNH."
"She is always nervous, and tells her sisters and brother everything."
"She went to Nilama Paragon Academy with Lute, and hates public speaking."
"She is one of seven children, with chin-length black hair; her darts can explode or cause sleep."
"Her oldest brother is an unwell Sway living on a residential ship off Anesidora."
"Her sister lives on the Apex side of Anesidora with her nephews."
"Her Sway brother's mind was damaged by an unregistered Sway, whom she wants to kill with darts."
"Her brother heard a mind on the Submerger boat, giving the System seconds of warning."
"She runs nearly as fast as an A-rank speedster."
